### Apply a newer update
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/updates
Content-Type: application/json

{"updateId":"update-1002","sku":"SKU-RED-SHOE-42","storeId":"STORE-101","quantity":17,"version":2,"eventTime":"2026-08-16T10:02:00Z"}

### Send an older event (ignored)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/updates
Content-Type: application/json

{"updateId":"update-1001","sku":"SKU-RED-SHOE-42","storeId":"STORE-101","quantity":9,"version":1,"eventTime":"2026-08-16T10:01:00Z"}

### Read cross-store summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/SKU-RED-SHOE-42/summary

### Detect near-duplicate payments within five minutes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transactions/duplicates?windowSeconds=300
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"transactionId":"T-1","accountId":"A-9","merchantId":"M-2","amountInCents":2599,"currency":"USD","timestamp":"2026-08-16T10:00:00Z"},
  {"transactionId":"T-2","accountId":"A-9","merchantId":"M-2","amountInCents":2599,"currency":"USD","timestamp":"2026-08-16T10:03:00Z"},
  {"transactionId":"T-3","accountId":"A-9","merchantId":"M-2","amountInCents":4000,"currency":"USD","timestamp":"2026-08-16T10:04:00Z"}
]

